1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
Aikin Arclight.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
Yadda za a ware cututtukan ido yayin rarraba gilashin ido?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
Lokacin rarraba gilashin ido yana da mahimmanci a ware wasu cututtukan ido na asali.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
Tare da ginshiƙi na gani da na'urar Arclight zaku iya gano wanda yake buƙata da sauri

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
gilashin da irin nau'in kuma wanda zai iya buƙatar turawa don wasu cututtuka irin su cataracts da

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Fara tare da nisa na gani acuity gwada ido ɗaya a lokaci guda ba tare da taimako ba kuma idan an rage yi amfani da rami.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
sannan a gwada hangen nesa kusa da idanu biyu tare.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
Yawanci akwai sakamako guda biyar masu yiwuwa.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
Idan nisan da ke kusa da acuity na gani yana da kyau duka,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
mai haƙuri baya buƙatar tabarau.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
Idan an rage hangen nesa nesa.

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
amma yana inganta tare da pinhole kuma hangen nesa kusa ba shi da kyau,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
sannan majiyyaci ya fi dan gajeriyar hangen nesa, wanda kuma aka fi sani da myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
Idan an rage hangen nesa nesa amma yana inganta tare da pinhole.

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
kuma kusantar gani ya ragu.

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
to, mai yiwuwa majiyyaci ya kasance dogon gani.

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
kuma aka sani da hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
Idan hangen nesa ya yi kyau,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
amma hangen nesa kusa ya ragu.

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
kuma mai haƙuri ya wuce shekaru 40,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
sannan sun danna biopia kuma suna buƙatar gilashin karatu.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
A ƙarshe, idan an rage ƙarfin gani

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
kuma ba ya inganta da pinhole ko tabarau.

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
to akwai yuwuwar kamuwa da ciwon ido na asali.

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
mara lafiya yana buƙatar jarrabawa tare da hasken baka.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Matsa zuwa ɗakin da ba shi da haske kuma fara da kai tsaye

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
almajiri haske reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Dukansu mutanen biyu su takura daidai da haske.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
Idan ba su yi ba

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
takura sosai, akwai yuwuwar kamuwa da cutar jijiyar gani ko retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
a bayansa

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
ido, kamar glaucoma ko cirewar ido.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Na gaba a duba jarrabawar reflex.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
Haske mai haske yana nufin babu wani abu mai toshewa

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
hasken dake shiga ido.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
Idan reflex ya ragu ko ba ya nan, to, cataract, corneal

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
tabo, jini a bayan ido ko ciwon daji, watakila ya toshe haske.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Na gaba duba gaba

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
na ido, kusa da madauki na gaba.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Nemo kowane kamuwa da cuta na corneal da tabo

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
ko cataract.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
A ƙarshe, yi optomoscopy kai tsaye kuma duba cikin bayan ido.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
Xammon optic

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
jijiya da kwayar ido don alamun glaucoma, thyroid retinopathy, tabo da retinal

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
ware.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
Idan kowace cuta ta kasance ko har yanzu ba za ku iya gano dalilin da yasa

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
hangen nesa mara lafiya yana da tsafta, sannan yi shiri don majiyyaci don ganin likitan ido.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
Wannan bidiyon yana nuna cewa ta hanyar aiki tare da jagoranci na yau da kullun,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
ma'aikatan kiwon lafiya na gabaɗaya, har ma da kayan aiki masu rahusa, za su iya fahimta idan a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
mara lafiya zai amfana da gilashin ido ko kuma yana buƙatar neman magani don maganin abin da ke ciki

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
